# MIGRATION.md §3 — the second half of the 0.10.0 break: after a call with
# arguments the compiler cannot know whether `and` was meant as a conjunction or
# as a separator, so it refuses with E0005 instead of guessing.
weave two into int:
  return 2

weave main into int:
  var x as int is calling two with 1 and 2
  return x
